## Hooks

Configured in `.claude/settings.json`. Adjust this table if you add or remove one.

| Event | Script | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| SessionStart | `session-start.sh` | Load dashboard, show priorities |
| PreToolUse (Bash) | `bash-validator.sh` | Block destructive commands |
| PostToolUse / PostToolUseFailure | `error-logger.sh` | Log error patterns |
| Stop | `memory-check.sh` | Remind to save state on long sessions |
| PreCompact | `pre-compact.sh` | Preserve critical context |
| PostCompact | `post-compact.sh` | Prompt to reload context |
| UserPromptSubmit | `agent-suggest.sh` | Suggest a skill by keyword |

